-#### Technologies (AI)
-
-- overhaul `FLAVOR_MILITARY` of techs so AI better understands/values the military importance of techs (e.g. TECH_CORPORATION 3->0 (not viewed as a military tech anymore), TECH_CIVIL_SERVICE 3->8 (viewed much more as a military tech, which matches our tech tree changes but also more generally should be more in line with its important military role))
-- devalue researching techs our vassal(s) or master already knows as this is inefficient, in `CvPlayerAI::AI_techValue`. See [KI#77](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#77---improved-devalue-researching-techs-our-master-or-vassals-already-knows-as-this-is-very-inefficient-anyways-etc). See also [Diplomacy (AI)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Custom_Main_Changes_Guide.md#diplomacy-ai). Update: also added vassal<->vassal(s) siblings devaluation to self research logic (if any of our sibling vassal(s) has the tech, devalue researching it ourselves).
-- value researching key military techs (high `FLAVOR_MILITARY`) much more when we are weaker, as economy or such techs are useless at best, or at worst we'd just be researching them for our ennemies after they conquer us. Change in `CvPlayerAI::AI_techValue`. In autoplay, this seemingly results in Ewuare not being able to sustain his early lead anymore. See [KI#81](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#81---tremendously-improved-ai-not-valuing-military-techs-for-research-enough-when-weaker). See also [Diplomacy (AI)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Custom_Main_Changes_Guide.md#diplomacy-ai).
