-#### Religions (AI)
-
-- Add military power weighting to religion valuing, so that AIs no longer (or much less) choose religions mostly based on who they already like no matter how weak or strong, but now mostly based on which religions are popular among the top military power players. The previous valuation used to lead to much worse diplomacy with them (less trades, more wars, etc.), sometimes even being or blunders of an AI suddenly being hated by almost everyone else due to a "random" very suboptimal religion change. Note: This valuation also applies to various areas related to how religion is viewed by the AI, according to chatgpt 5.1, such as the evaluation of state-religion-dependent civics, espionage (change a target's religion), trade / demand value of “adopt religion X”. Change in `CvPlayerAI::AI_religionValue`. See [KI#82](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#82---tremendously-improved-ai-not-adopting-the-popular-religion-among-strong-rivals-thus-being-hated-and-more-likely-to-lose).
